OL,3,GNEWSATwenty-seven people rescued from
OL,4,Arollercoaster
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have rescued 27 people who
OL,7,Fwere stuck on a rollercoaster for up to
OL,8,Fthree hours.
OL,10,FSuffolk Fire and Rescue Service said it
OL,11,Fwas called to Pleasurewood Hills in
OL,12,FLowestoft at 13:36 BST.
OL,14,FThe emergency service said the
OL,15,Fcarriages of the Wipeout ride came to a
OL,16,Fstop on the track, while approximately
OL,17,F15m (49ft) in the air, "but not
OL,18,Fupside-down".
